            <creation xml:id="creation_id41630d22">
               <date isodate="1842-01-21" xml:id="date_0c545f83">21 January 1842</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_idcf6eb9c3">
               <p xml:id="idm106">The text is part of Adam Oehlenschläger's play "Sankt Hansaften-Spil", published in his "Digte 1803", where it is called "De Kiørende" (The Travellers). Gade composed an overture to the play in 1841, which was performed at The Royal Theatre in Copenhagen in April 1842. It is not known whether the song was used in these performances of the play. The song became very popular and was published in numerous editions and arrangements in the 19th century.</p>
            </history>
